          "question": "Which sign-in method should ship first?",
          "options": [
            "Email magic link",
            "GitHub OAuth",
            "Both at once"
          ],
          "askedBy": "claude-code",
          "askedAt": "2026-10-03T14:17:16.163Z",
          "context": "Magic link: no password to store, needs an email sender (about 2 days). GitHub OAuth: fastest for developers, excludes non-developers (about 1 day). Both: covers everyone, about 4 days and two flows to test. The choice decides what the sign-in screen looks like."
        }
      ]
